      "snippet_id": "SNP-001",
      "snippet_text": "\"Webhooks allow you to set up integrations which subscribe to certain events from your Payhip store. There are 4 webhook events available for you to listen from.\" Events: paid, refunded, subscription.created, subscription.deleted. \"If your endpoint does not return a 200 HTTP status code, the POST is retried once an hour for up to 3 hours.\"",
